      ],
      "tips": [
        "For extra flavor, add a sprinkle of red pepper flakes to the asparagus before roasting.",
        "You can substitute other quick-cooking vegetables like broccoli or green beans for asparagus.",
        "Ensure your salmon is fully defrosted if using frozen fillets for even cooking."
